---
import Todo from '@/components/ui/Todo.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import CapabilityLayout from '@/layouts/CapabilityLayout.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What wire sizes can you coil?',
    a: `${site.capability.wireRangeLabel}. Outer diameter and length follow the drawing. Above 2.50 mm wire is outside our range.`,
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you form wire forms as well as springs?',
    a: 'Yes. Clips, hooks and pins from the same wire range, to your drawing.',
  },
];
---

<CapabilityLayout
  route="coilingForming"
  title="Spring Coiling & Wire Forming in Pune"
  description="Spring coiling and wire forming, wire Ø 0.40–2.50 mm, to drawing or sample in Talawade, Pune. Quote within 24 hours."
  h1="Spring coiling and forming"
  lede="Helices and bends from 0.40–2.50 mm wire. This is the work our unit is built around."
  context="a coiled spring"
  faqs={faqs}
  related={[
    {
      to: 'heatTreatment',
      label: 'Stress relieving and grinding',
      description: 'What happens after the coil.',
    },
    {
      to: 'prototype',
      label: 'Prototype development',
      description: 'Sample first, then the bulk lot.',
    },
    {
      to: 'springs',
      label: 'Springs we make',
      description: 'Torsion through conical, plus wire forms.',
    },
  ]}
>
  <h2>What it is</h2>
  <p>
    We coil torsion, double torsion, extension, compression, conical and spiral springs, and we form
    clips, hooks and pins. Wire {site.capability.wireRangeLabel}. Outer diameter and free length
    follow the drawing.
  </p>
  <p>
    <Todo text="machine list and name-plate photos, before we name any machine." />
  </p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>
    The wire is formed into the helix or the bend on the drawing. Ends, hooks and legs are formed to
    the specified type. The batch then goes through our stress-relieving furnace. Ends are ground
    when the drawing asks. Plating and other finishes leave the building.
  </p>

  <h2>When to use us</h2>
  <p>
    When the part is in our wire range, the quantity is in the {site.terms.moq} band (or you will
    pay development charges), and you have a drawing or a sample. We quote within 24 hours.
  </p>

  <h2>Limits</h2>
  <p>
    Wire {site.capability.wireRangeLabel}. Rolling-shutter, agriculture and heavier springs sit
    outside this range. We supply across India, ex-works Talawade.
  </p>
</CapabilityLayout>
